4,1,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure we can actually finish the work on time. I'll look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'll be keeping an eye on the money. I'm going to check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I would like to see how our previous projects have held up over time. I will look into the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I want to understand the human element of the maintenance. I will look into the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll focus on the practicalities of the site's usage. I'll look into the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Minato,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, I see we're both looking into the groundskeeping roll. I'm curious if you're looking for the same red flags I am, or if you have a different angle?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I just want to ensure we are being kind to the people who will maintain the park, dear. I believe a gentle approach to planning helps everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, I am more concerned with the actual capacity of the staff. I want to know if there are enough hands to keep the park beautiful without burning people out.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems we are all circling the same drain of sustainability. I'm just hoping the data on crossings and drainage actually reflects how people use the space, rather than some idealized version.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Minato,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, you're always so cynical! But you're right about the ""idealized version."" I just want to make sure the city isn't dreaming up a paradise it can't actually afford to keep.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree with May. It is much better to have a modest garden that flourishes than a grand palace that falls into ruin.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. A plan that looks wonderful on a brochure but fails in practice is a disservice to the community and the staff.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. I'm just here to make sure we don't build a fancy pond that turns into a swamp or a path that everyone ignores. Let's see what the data actually says.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'm glad we all agree on being careful. I'll stick with my choices so I can help us understand the construction side of things. I'm looking forward to seeing what we all find.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,Me too! Let's hope the numbers are a bit more friendly than they usually are. I'll see you all in the next round with the results.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall be waiting patiently. I hope the records show that we can build something that truly lasts for the children and grandchildren of this city.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will be as well. I hope we find a balance that respects both the land and the people who will care for it.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Right. Let's get these requests in and stop talking in circles. I'll see you all when the facts are on the table.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
